{"id":"1f468692d9334725","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-parallel-rewrite.md","title":"df-parallel-rewrite","display":"df-parallel-rewrite","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","[[56-df-replace]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]"],"label":"56-df-parallel-rewrite","aliases":["56-df-parallel-rewrite"],"display":"df-parallel-rewrite","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-parallel-rewrite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-parallel-rewrite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-parallel-rewrite"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-parallel-rewrite\"><code>df-parallel-rewrite</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)\">\\(R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>；规则和一步关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a>。</li>\n<li>位置关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\perp\">\\(\\perp\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>，同时替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ParRep}\">\\(\\operatorname{ParRep}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a>；项替换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Rightarrow_R t\\iff\n\\exists P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\,\\exists v:P\\to T\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;(p\\ne q\\Rightarrow p\\perp q)\n\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\,\\exists\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\;\n(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land v(p)=r\\sigma)\n\\land t=\\operatorname{ParRep}(s,P,v)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Rightarrow_R t\\iff\n\\exists P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\,\\exists v:P\\to T\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;(p\\ne q\\Rightarrow p\\perp q)\n\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\,\\exists\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\;\n(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land v(p)=r\\sigma)\n\\land t=\\operatorname{ParRep}(s,P,v)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同时收缩有限个两两不交的redex。P=∅ 允许零收缩的恒等并行步；有限性来自 Pos(s) 的有限性。原式遗漏 p≠q，错误地要求 p 与自身不交，且未定义同时替换。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，定义4.3.1、4.7.3及引理4.7.4，印刷第100、120页，OCR页块121、141。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-parallel-rewrite","text":"`df-parallel-rewrite`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-replace","status":"resolved","id":"b58d01262349aaf3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-replace]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$；规则和一步关系见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]、[[56-df-rewrite-step]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$；规则和一步关系见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]、[[56-df-rewrite-step]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"位置关系 $\\perp$ 见 [[56-df-position]]，同时替换 $\\operatorname{ParRep}$ 见 [[56-df-replace]]；项替换见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-replace","status":"resolved","id":"b58d01262349aaf3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"位置关系 $\\perp$ 见 [[56-df-position]]，同时替换 $\\operatorname{ParRep}$ 见 [[56-df-replace]]；项替换见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"位置关系 $\\perp$ 见 [[56-df-position]]，同时替换 $\\operatorname{ParRep}$ 见 [[56-df-replace]]；项替换见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\perp","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ParRep}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"s\\Rightarrow_R t\\iff\n\\exists P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\,\\exists v:P\\to T\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;(p\\ne q\\Rightarrow p\\perp q)\n\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\,\\exists\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\;\n(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land v(p)=r\\sigma)\n\\land t=\\operatorname{ParRep}(s,P,v)\n\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1501,"backlinks":[{"id":"b06f8242a0a4824a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\leadsto_R$ 是原书 multi-step relation：允许嵌套初始 redex，区别于 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]] 只同时收缩两两不交的 redex。本节只定义存在关系，存在性与唯一目标由后续 FD、FD! 提供。"},{"id":"e82b4135b6aba06c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定上述正交系统，$s\\in T$，$U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$ 且 $\\operatorname{Disj}(U)$。$\\operatorname{PC}_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]，$\\operatorname{CDev}_R$ 与有限路径首尾投影见 [[56-df-complete-development]]，完整发展唯一目标见 [[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]，平行关系见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]，残余拼接律见 [[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]。"},{"id":"cdd1f74aa0c940f7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\to_R$、$\\to_R^*$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]；$\\Rightarrow_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]。"},{"id":"034ceadbaaf08241","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\to_R$、$\\to_R^*$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]，$\\Rightarrow_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]。"},{"id":"1a7c117bc54a8d10","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)$，$\\Rightarrow_R$ 为 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]] 的有限位置平行步。"},{"id":"b4594163bf46851f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Rightarrow_R$、替换应用和变量集见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]、[[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-variables]]。"},{"id":"53cadc7f4a7b8337","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$，$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 且 $\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s$。路径接口见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]；残余传送及拼接律见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]、[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]。完整发展菱形见 [[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]，不交完整发展与 $\\operatorname{PC}_R$ 见 [[56-lem-disjoint-complete-development]]、[[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]，$\\to_R^*$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]，$\\Rightarrow_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]。$D,z$ 为以下定义的局部对象。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-parallel-rewrite.md]]"},{"id":"b90aafd738db3274","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"正交性和合流见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]、[[56-df-confluent]]；平行移动及平行关系见 [[56-lem-parallel-moves]]、[[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]。"}],"outgoing":["a6c29a8d098ef0ed","a3b60e1e9cdeef27","b58d01262349aaf3","da02033e6d596cae","6aa7f56f36c897f4"]}